sha":"189dbdcd74f08e8e62a28333605feaf0e588f833","position":"1795126786587383396-bad94bcf-3314-4f2f-b5b6-ce2576c9602e"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIGNNmnI/WYNJAOKH9yvo0l+tMYJR2tK2UV4H8ReXBQU5 rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com rotated-20260907"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1795114377192718375,"creation_channel":"mcp","deps":[{"link_uuid":"35071b57-b296-47e9-8505-5f90f6dc8003","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"977f-11fe-1dcb-4b7d"},{"link_uuid":"75410499-2d0c-4564-89a8-6a60f8767054","relation":"depends_on","target_id":"387c-d59c-7854-40b2"},{"link_uuid":"bad94bcf-3314-4f2f-b5b6-ce2576c9602e","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"a3e9-1f6f-d345-43e9"}],"description":"## Observation\nIn `sweep (windows)` diag run 44591481319 (throwaway branch `w1-diag-opcert-acl`, carrying the plump-smelly-indianabat and undamaging-ashamed-wasp fixes), `tests/unit/test_opcert_key_copy_leak_tortoise.py::test_signer_test_modules_leave_no_key_copy_in_the_temp_dir` failed. Its nested pytest run of `test_opcert_service.py` + `test_opcert_service_integrity.py` reported 7 failed, 9 passed. One failure is `git commit failed ... open(\"<id>/<event>-CREATE.json\"): Filename too long`. The others are jobs ending with `status: error`. In the same run, the same tests run outside the nesting all pass.\n\n## Cause (hypothesis, tested by the change)\nThe test roots the nested run's TMPDIR sandbox (`tmp_path/tmpdir-sandbox`) and its basetemp (`tmp_path/run/nested-pytest`) under its own `tmp_path`. On the runner that is `C:\\Users\\runneradmin\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\pytest-of-runneradmin\\pytest-0\\popen-gw0\\test_signer_test_modules_leave0\\`. Job workspaces (`rebar-opcert-ws-*\\.tickets-tracker\\<id>\\<long event name>.json`) and ticket stores under that prefix pass Windows' 260-character MAX_PATH, and git is not built with `core.longpaths`.\n\n## Approach\nTest-only change. A new fixture `short_root` creates `tempfile.mkdtemp(prefix=\"tort-\")` directly under the system temp dir, so the root is short, private and unique per test. The test uses `short_root/\"t\"` as the TMPDIR sandbox and `short_root/\"r\"` as the nested basetemp root. The fixture removes the root in a `finally`. The leak assertion (no `rebar-opcert-*` left in the sandbox) is unchanged. No product code, config key, env var or flag changes. Portable: uses `tempfile` and `pathlib` only.\n\n## Scope\n- `tests/unit/test_opcert_key_copy_leak_tortoise.py` — the fixture and the test's two paths.\n\n## Testing\n- The test itself passes on macOS/Linux (`make verify`), and on Windows in a pre-merge diag run on the throwaway branch.\n- After merge: it passes in a `sweep (windows)` run on main.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] `test_signer_test_modules_leave_no_key_copy_in_the_temp_dir` roots its nested TMPDIR and basetemp in a short private temp dir that it removes afterwards, and still asserts no key copy is left behind.\n- [ ] The test passes in a `sweep (windows)` run on main.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[{"path":"tests/unit/test_opcert_key_copy_leak_tortoise.py","reason":"short private nested temp root"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","managed_refs":[["depends_on","387c-d59c-7854-40b2"],["relates_to","a3e9-1f6f-d345-43e9"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"0540d12f-a985-4da9-8bfc-81a8117af2c9","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"releases":[],"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"in_progress","tags":["windows","portability","tests"],"ticket_id":"d4f1-da58-0748-4e1a","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Windows: the nested signer-module leak test exceeds MAX_PATH (\"Filename too long\") under its tmp_path sandbox","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["9d57f178-a965-4e11-8076-33e9e6de1d4f","0c8c8526-b3e8-465f-b43e-b5e27524488b","35071b57-b296-47e9-8505-5f90f6dc8003","b443259d-3d05-4248-b624-caa721a078b6","0540d12f-a985-4da9-8bfc-81a8117af2c9","4fb2dcd4-6b8f-4117-9b0a-12ec2341e98a","75410499-2d0c-4564-89a8-6a60f8767054","bad94bcf-3314-4f2f-b5b6-ce2576c9602e"]},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1795126786587383397,"uuid":"50a751f8-7d98-4af7-b9b9-a3d3055213b9"}